1
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,840
In the late Northern Song Dynasty,

2
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,200
the government was corrupt,

3
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,530
wars raged on for years,

4
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,600
and the people lived in destitution.

5
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,480
Righteous martial artists from all over

6
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,720
snuck into Dongjing,

7
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,960
attempting to approach the Emperor

8
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,720
to change the situation.

9
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,240
Officers of Bingjingwu.

10
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,770
Open the door immediately!

11
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,039
Where is the Director?

12
00:01:30,039 --> 00:01:31,039
In the ice cellar.

13
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:37,860
My Lord.

14
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,240
Bodies of strangers were found outside the city.

15
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,680
They were all killed by highly skilled martial artists.

16
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,120
The horses ridden by the victims

17
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,650
were all top-grade steeds.

18
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:44,920
I originally thought

19
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,920
it was a revenge killing.

20
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,320
On one of them,

21
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,520
I found a silk letter.

22
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,840
This silk letter...

23
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,170
It is written in cipher.

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
The contents of the silk script are still unknown.

25
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,729
I will have someone decode it as soon as possible.

26
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,460
No need.

27
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:59,680
I will find someone to decode it tomorrow.

28
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,610
What about the hoofbeats just now?

29
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,770
It was an emergency.

30
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,520
I rode the dead man's horse

31
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,820
to hurry back here.

32
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,930
Send these horses to the mule market tomorrow

33
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,120
and sell them.

34
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,860
Let's see who comes to buy this horse.

35
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,760
The shopkeeper said today,

36
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,360
whoever brings in customers

37
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,690
gets double the reward.

38
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,480
Is it true?

39
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,200
Let's go.

40
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,520
Come in and take a look.

41
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,160
It won't cost you much.

42
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,840
Come to our shop to rest and have a drink.

43
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,480
Come on, sir.

44
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,760
No, thanks.

45
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:48,610
To make a living as a loafer,

46
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,760
you don't need to be all things to all men.

47
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,960
Spend a little money.

48
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:52,840
Hanging out at the theater

49
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,800
and reading storybooks

50
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,160
can bring great benefits.

51
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:56,690
Look at that guy over there.

52
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,960
He looks strong,

53
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,960
but his steps are getting unsteady.

54
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,280
I'm afraid he is sick.

55
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,360
I presume he has already exhausted his wealth recently.

56
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,280
Look at that one.

57
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,680
He is wearing fine silk clothes,

58
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,880
but there isn't a single piece of jade or precious jewelry on him.

59
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,840
Just a gambler.

60
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,200
They might be regretting

61
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,400
their misplaced bet.

62
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,010
Look at that one.

63
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,560
I am known as the geographic genius of Dongjing,

64
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,480
Meng Qian, the second brother Meng.

65
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:31,079
Can you be more familiar with

66
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:34,040
these four rivers and thirty-two bridges than me?

67
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,680
Guest,

68
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,920
is this your first time in Dongjing?

69
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:57,320
Yes.

70
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,600
Let me show you the way.

71
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,000
Okay.

72
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,400
Meng Xiao Er.

73
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:02,760
Thank you.

74
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:16,959
You two.

75
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,850
First time in Dongjing?

76
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,540
Daoist Master.

77
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:27,480
This young man

78
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,080
is the most famous idler in Bianjing City.

79
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:29,560
I

80
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,760
read my fortune before going out today.

81
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,520
It said I

82
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,680
would meet noble people.

83
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,940
And here I met you two as soon as I came out.

84
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,080
You two must be

85
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,520
my noble people.

86
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,240
We are newcomers.

87
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,159
We are unfamiliar with this place.

88
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:44,159
Could you show us around?

89
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,040
Sure.

90
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:50,120
Oh, show you around?

91
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,640
Walking around.

92
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:57,800
Okay.

93
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,800
Leave it to me.

94
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:04,120
Situ Zhen looked for that idler to lead the way.

95
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,920
The war in the south is critical.

96
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,760
Situ Zhen is not on the frontline,

97
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:09,400
but comes to Bianjing instead.

98
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,660
What is his intention?

99
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,200
Keep an eye on him.

100
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:43,800
Excuse me.

101
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,520
Let me see.

102
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,800
Selling horses.

103
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:48,960
Good horses.

104
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:49,680
Twenty taels each.

105
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,040
Sir,

106
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,040
take a look at the top-grade horses.

107
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,320
Untie me.

108
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,200
All right.

109
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,920
This silk text has been secretly arranged.

110
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,440
A rough glance

111
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:26,400
shows it mentions the Shangyuan Festival.

112
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:28,060
Please wait a moment, sister.

113
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,570
Sister-in-law.

114
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,080
You are back.

115
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,490
Why are you earlier than usual?

116
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,380
I made a huge profit today.

117
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:48,040
Now we have money for Xiaolian's medicine.

118
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,880
You are back.

119
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,940
Are you feeling better today?

120
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,240
Getting better every day.

121
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,450
Sister-in-law.

122
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,920
Xiaolian wants to get out of bed and eat at the table.

123
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,520
No.

124
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,920
The spring cold has just arrived.

125
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,120
She is very weak.

126
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,600
All right.

127
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,200
You watch the stove.

128
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:26,460
I'll go in and help Xiaolian get dressed.

129
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,810
Sister-in-law,

130
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,400
is this cooked?

131
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,640
Haven't you finished dressing?

132
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,610
Sister-in-law.

133
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:55,440
Xiaolian.

134
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,320
Brother Meng,

135
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,040
calm down.

136
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,540
What are you doing?

137
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,080
Brother Li Lang's knockout drops

138
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:32,679
just make them sleep more soundly.

139
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,919
You wouldn't want them to see you like this, would you?

140
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:35,850
Knockout drops?

141
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,320
My little sister is already physically weak.

142
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,840
You...

143
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,260
Let go of my sister.

144
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,090
Come at me if you have a problem.

145
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,400
After taking that pill,

146
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:03,120
even if there is only one breath left,

147
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,320
a person can be saved.

148
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,600
Although this medicine is highly effective,

149
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,060
you must take one pill a day

150
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,300
for several months

151
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:10,930
to see miraculous results.

152
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:11,840
Otherwise...

153
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,130
Otherwise what?

154
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,600
Missing a single day

155
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,720
will ruin everything,

156
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,980
and even gods cannot save you.

157
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,600
You...

158
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,880
Making things so difficult for a junior like me,

159
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:27,560
why?

160
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,440
Mr. Meng,

161
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:31,090
you're no ordinary junior.

162
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,080
Your ancestors served in the Ministry of War,

163
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,540
specializing in mapping.

164
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:36,930
By your generation,

165
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,480
your family fortune declined.

166
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,080
But you have profound family knowledge.

167
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,760
You grew up

168
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,320
in Dongjing.

169
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,560
You're known as

170
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,810
the Dongjing Geography Ghost.

171
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,080
We came here

172
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,560
to ask you

173
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,280
to continue being our guide.

174
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:54,770
This is the deposit.

175
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,440
When it's done,

176
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,960
you'll get more than ten times this.

177
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,080
I need to be alive to spend it.

178
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,920
We have long admired the prosperity of Dongjing.

179
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,880
I hope Meng

180
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,440
can, on Shangyuan Night,

181
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,370
help us brothers

182
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,400
ascend the West Tower of Fanlou

183
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:11,520
to see Dongjing City lit up by lanterns.

184
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,240
Fanlou.

185
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,240
Sister.

186
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,560
Fanlou.

187
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:21,850
Assassination.

188
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,720
Shangyuan Night.

189
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:25,960
The Emperor.
